Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/trace/ is a TypeScript port of the trace-parsing layer of
`tools/esp_app_trace/espytrace/sysview.py` from ESP-IDF
(https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf), Copyright Espressif Systems,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

src/trace/os/freertos.ts is generated from
`tools/esp_app_trace/SYSVIEW_FreeRTOS.txt` in ESP-IDF
(https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf), Copyright Espressif Systems,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

src/trace/os/zephyr.ts is generated from
`subsys/tracing/sysview/SYSVIEW_Zephyr.txt` in the Zephyr RTOS
(https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr), Copyright the Zephyr
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The `.svdat` container this viewer reads was defined by SEGGER
Microcontroller GmbH. No SEGGER source code, description file, or sample
recording is included in this repository; the parser was written against the
Apache-2.0 ESP-IDF reference implementation named above. SEGGER and SystemView
are trademarks of SEGGER Microcontroller GmbH and are used here only to
identify that file format.

The trace and ELF fixtures under test/fixtures/ are captures of Espressif demo
applications recorded by Espressif; see test/fixtures/README.md for the
provenance of each file.
